## 10. MVP Plan and Open Points

### 10.1 Recommended MVP

1.  Start with the first 100 documents.
2.  Obtain the KG team's approved baseline and known limitations.
3.  Classify a representative sample of entities as Highly, Average, or
    Poorly Enriched.
4.  Create a manageable golden-question set across all three categories,
    including expected abstentions.
5.  Retain source references and spot-check selected expected answers.
6.  Run the same questions through the relevant KG, Vector DB, and RAG
    paths.
7.  Calculate the six primary KPIs and record the initial results as
    Baseline V1.
8.  After each additional 100-document batch, run regression,
    enrichment, and repeatability checks; then version and retain the
    results.

Numerical pass/fail thresholds should be agreed with stakeholders after
the first baseline results are available. Do not assume that
illustrative enrichment bands are automatically acceptance thresholds
for AI quality.

